---
// $10/Day Traffic Machine Starter Map, rebuilt 20 Nov 2026 on Jodie's Etsy template.
import TemplateLayout from "../../layouts/TemplateLayout.astro";
import { membership } from "../../data/facts.js";

// Canon products[] row: "$10/Day Traffic Machine" + "Starter Map", $0, Beacons.
// The canon name carries a dash; the page sets it on two lines instead
// (title, then "Starter Map" as a subtitle), so no punctuation is invented.
// Beacons id is 8dcfbb25 (never 8dfcbb25).
const BEACONS = "https://links.thedigitalincomeedit.com/shop/8dcfbb25-bc42-47b2-8490-cfa9c1a577a8";

const inside = [
  "The four-stage pipeline: ad, landing page, list, offer, and why skipping one costs you the whole budget",
  "The four numbers that actually diagnose a failing ad, and the thirty-six you can ignore",
  "The two rules that protect you from your own panic: the 72-hour rule and the 10 to 20% rule",
];
---
<TemplateLayout title="Free Guide: The $10/Day Traffic Machine Starter Map" description="The free Starter Map: the whole paid traffic pipeline on one page (ad, landing page, list, offer). Fill in four boxes before you spend a dollar." stickyHref={BEACONS} stickyLabel="Get the free Starter Map">

<section class="hh">
 <div class="wrap hh-grid bp2-hh">
  <div class="box">
   <span class="stk" style="right:-60px;top:-56px">Free<b class="big">guide</b></span>
   <svg class="spk" style="left:-26px;bottom:60px;position:absolute"><use href="#sp"/></svg>
   <p class="kick">Free resource · Automation &amp; paid traffic</p>
   <h1>The $10/Day Traffic Machine <span class="scr">Starter Map</span></h1>
   <p class="what">The entire pipeline on one page (ad, landing page, list, offer) <b>and the four boxes you fill in before you spend a cent.</b></p>
   <a class="btn buy" href={BEACONS}>Get the free Starter Map <span class="ar">→</span></a>
   <p class="ab2-alt">Opens the Starter Map's download page on Beacons, the shop that delivers the file.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="bp2-fig"><div class="hh-ph"><img src="/images/pages/starter-map-cover-480.webp" srcset="/images/pages/starter-map-cover-480.webp 480w, /images/pages/starter-map-cover-720.webp 720w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 80vw, 340px" width="480" height="640" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="Cover of The $10/Day Traffic Machine Starter Map: the title in large dark and pink type, a woman seen from behind holding a phone showing an ad dashboard, beside pink peonies, a coffee cup and a stack of books."></div><figcaption class="ab2-cap"><b>The Starter Map</b> · Free · PDF</figcaption></figure>
 </div>
</section>

<div class="band"><svg class="spk" style="left:18%"><use href="#sp"/></svg><h2>Why it exists</h2><svg class="spk sm" style="right:19%"><use href="#sp"/></svg></div>
<section class="sec wash">
 <div class="wrap">
  <h2 class="h2">An ad is a faucet with a dial. <span class="scr">It doesn't build the pipe.</span></h2>
  <div class="card dash bp2-who">
   <p>When an ad burns money in its first week, it almost always goes the same way: the budget goes on before anyone can name what happens after the click. The ad works. The click lands somewhere that isn't ready. The money is gone and the lesson isn't.</p>
   <p>This free guide is the pipe on one page: four boxes, in order, and you don't spend a dollar until all four have names in them.</p>
   <p class="sm2-h">Inside, you'll get</p>
   <div class="faq bp2-parts">{inside.map((x, i) => <div class="qa"><span class="n">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span><div><p>{x}</p></div></div>)}</div>
   <a class="btn buy sm2-btn" href={BEACONS}>Get the free Starter Map <span class="ar">→</span></a>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
 <div class="wrap">
  <p class="kick">Then keep going</p>
  <h2 class="h2">Where to <span class="scr">go next.</span></h2>
  <div class="ab2-rooms">
   <a class="card dash" href="/resources/faceless-income-blueprint"><span class="hm-lab">FREE GUIDE</span><h3>Build the pipe before you turn on the faucet.</h3><p>The Faceless Income Blueprint™ is the machine the ad is pointing at, on one page.</p><span class="btn">Get the Blueprint <span class="ar">→</span></span></a>
   <a class="card dash" href="/membership"><span class="hm-lab">Membership Premium</span><h3>Run ads without guessing.</h3><p>The Ads Edit™ comes with Membership Premium at {membership.premium.perMonth}: what to spend, what to read, and when to leave it alone.</p><span class="btn">See what's inside <span class="ar">→</span></span></a>
   <a class="card dash" href="/learn/automating-your-online-business"><span class="hm-lab">The full guide</span><h3>The full system.</h3><p>The long guide the Starter Map sits inside, with every stage explained in order.</p><span class="btn">Read the guide <span class="ar">→</span></span></a>
  </div>
  <p class="see" style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px"><a href="/resources">← All free resources</a></p>
 </div>
</section>
</TemplateLayout>
